NoncePinPolicy::initializeWithMultiplexer
├── given init data of exactly one word
│   ├── it should store the nonce against the calling multiplexer
│   └── it should emit PolicySet
├── given the config was already initialized
│   └── it should overwrite the stored nonce
├── given init data of any other length
│   ├── given empty init data
│   │   └── it should revert with InvalidInitDataLength
│   └── given a short or over-long blob
│       └── it should revert with InvalidInitDataLength
└── given another multiplexer, account or config
    └── it should keep the entries independent
